  "description": "One-stop shop for orchestrating groups of LLMs as a \"legion\" — voting, polling, scoring, proofreading, and persona-driven multi-voter workflows. Bundles a 1024-persona library. Credential resolution flows through MindAttic.Vault: hosts call MindAtticCredentialStore.UseConfiguration(IConfiguration) to consume User Secrets / App Service Application Settings / Azure Key Vault, with the legacy %APPDATA%/MindAttic/LLM file kept as a backward-compat fallback. The bundled CLI wires this automatically.",
